  "denseSurfaces": [
    {
      "surface": "DataTable body (`.dt-scroll`, data-dense)",
      "why": "rows keep xs row-action buttons so a 44px floor would not reflow every table on touch",
      "alternative": "row menu / grid keyboard model (arrow keys, Enter) reach every row action; column sort buttons already render 44px inside the body on touch (measured)"
    },
    {
      "surface": "DataTable icon-tool cluster (`.dt-view-tools`, data-dense) + stray `.dt-tool` export/add triggers",
      "why": "owner-directed 24px square icon recipe (one box app-wide)",
      "alternative": "every tool is a focusable button/trigger with a Tooltip label; filter/group/columns are also reachable from the row context menu and keyboard"
    },
    {
      "surface": "Chart canvases (`Chart.svelte` img container, `EChartsSparkline`)",
      "why": "third-party render surface (ECharts) — no DOM controls to grow",
      "alternative": "Chart ships an accessible data table (`chart-alt`)"
    }
  ],
  "escapesLeftDense": [
    {
      "rule": "src/app.css .chip-x { min-height: 0 }",
      "reason": "chip × sits inside a 24px pill; the chip itself is the 44px target under (hover: none), the × is always visible there"
    },
    {
      "rule": "src/app.css .dt-chip-clear { min-height: 0 }",
      "reason": "filter-bar text button; same chip-bar surface"
    },
    {
      "rule": "src/routes/(app)/stock/items/[id]/+page.svelte .total-line :global(.link-btn)",
      "reason": "inline text link-button inside a totals line; scoped rule outranks the baseline"
    },
    {
      "rule": "src/routes/(app)/settings/tables/+page.svelte .fields-head :global(.reset-btn)",
      "reason": "inline reset affordance in a card header"
    },
    {
      "rule": "src/routes/(app)/crm/[contactId]/+page.svelte + src/lib/components/pos/SellableEditorPage.svelte :global(.card-action)",
      "reason": "card-header inline action; scoped rule outranks the baseline"
    },
    {
      "rule": "src/lib/components/tags/TagOptionList.svelte .swatches :global(.swatch)",
      "reason": "colour swatch grid inside a popover"
    },
    {
      "rule": "src/lib/components/scheduling/FieldsList.svelte .hc-field :global(.hc-field-btn)",
      "reason": "drag-reorder row control"
    },
    {
      "rule": "src/lib/components/scheduling/BookingCalendar.svelte .m-more / .m-num / .cc-manage",
      "reason": "month-cell micro controls; calendar is its own dense surface"
    },
    {
      "rule": "Tailwind `min-h-*` utilities",
      "reason": "none found on button/role elements (grep `<(button|Button)[^>]*min-h-` = 0); utilities would be beaten anyway because the baseline is un-layered"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Before already had 0 unmarked sub-44 targets on collection/board/form/dashboard/gallery/detail/workspace because the shared @minion-stack/ui controls and the DataTable search field carry their own coarse rules (spec 012); the controls recipe exposed the one gap (a native undecorated <button>, 24px -> 44px after).",
    "At 1440px fine pointer, `compact` (today) measures identically before/after for every sampled control (xs 24 / sm 28 / md 32 / input 32 / table cell 36.5 / toolbar 36 / page header 57). `comfortable` changes only the DataTable row (`--dt-row-h` 44 -> 52, cell 36.5 -> 44.5) and `--active-control-min-height` (32 -> 44); no role consumer reads that token at a fine pointer by design (coordinator decision), so comfortable on desktop is table rows only until a follow-up decides whether to consume it there.",
    "tbody tr reports height 0 because the virtualized rows size through their cells; the td.dt-cell rect is the row measure."
  ]
}
